# Only needed for a standalone static deployment (e.g. Vercel) that talks to
# a separately-hosted FastAPI backend. Leave unset for local dev (Vite's
# proxy in vite.config.ts forwards API calls to http://localhost:8000) and
# for same-origin production (FastAPI serving the built frontend directly).
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com
